    <title>EP23| 手机控：实用与虚无的快感并存</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66744037c26e396a3637be7b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66744037c26e396a3637be7b</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 20 Jun 2024 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>·手机作为年轻人不可或缺的一个“器官”，它究竟给我们的日常生活带来了什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span>·我们使用频率最高的APP是什么？为什么离不开它们？</span></p><span></span><p><span>·这些手机里的“好物推荐”倾囊分享给大家！</span></p><span></span><p><span>（PS：歌歌因个人原因，这期后将暂停播客录制。节目后续内容类型不变，形式目前夏夏暂定为单人播客。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期最后一期双人版，且听且珍惜~）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="58">00:58</a> 屏幕使用时长：躺平闲人8h，上班族10h+</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="382">06:22</a> 享受刷手机带来的虚无的乐趣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="584">09:44</a> 刷到鸡汤赶紧划走？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="800">13:20</a> 刷抖音&amp;看综艺：同时进行，风险对冲，成本平摊，划算！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="807">13:27</a> 作业伴侣</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="864">14:24</a>-<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3190">53:10</a> 我们的常用软件</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>一、社交类：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>·social：微信</span></p><span></span><p><span>·media：小红书、抖音 、微博</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二、阅读类：</span></strong><span>网盘/晋江/夸克/豆瓣/微信读书</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三、信息获取类：</span></strong><span>通过搜索或筛选，有选择的摄取</span></p><span></span><p><span>·知识观点：小宇宙</span></p><span></span><p><span>·休闲娱乐：大众点评&amp;美团</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>四.购物类：</span></strong><span>淘宝</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3216">53:36</a> 当我不在家时，我的小鸡居然一直在被人揍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3375">56:15</a> 寻找小众APP之旅</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝歌歌前程似锦🌟</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］（备注来意啊~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务合作：添加微信［xwn_2011615156］</span></strong></p>]]></description>
