  <item>
    <title>EP21｜《懒人焦虑自救指南》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66261abc200abebe6e75d057</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66261abc200abebe6e75d057</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 23 Apr 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>【收听指南】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目请按需服用，自律人士误入，欢迎懒人、重度拖延爱好者前来收听借鉴～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 焦虑的来源和本质</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a> 用一个下午写完毕业论文，根本没时间焦虑。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="499">08:19</a> 一个人对接37个部门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> 如何游刃有余的协调同事配合你的工作？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> J人拆解目标，P人闷头狂干？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="895">14:55</a> 我不可能为世界上任何一件事熬个通宵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="995">16:35</a> 在戒断反应中获得自虐式的快感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1044">17:24</a> 无痛自律：学会顺着人性投机取巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1103">18:23</a> 我们在生活中太需要意义感了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1236">20:36</a> 觉得自己运势不佳（水逆），其实是你在隐性焦虑</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 隐性焦虑的寻找方式和解决方案</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1640">27:20</a> “在失去中建立自己”</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1647">27:27</a> 两个适合懒人的焦虑自救方法</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1768">29:28</a> 焦虑的反义词是具体</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1786">29:46</a> 神化自己，焦虑退散！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1894">31:34</a> 金句和鸡汤，适用范围十分有限</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：《Sweet Talk》— Saint Motel</span></p><span></span><p><span>“End of the world” — 高天佐/法老/张太郎</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云歌单：《蓬松计划》BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］（备注来意啊~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务合作：添加微信［glamorousgia］</span></strong></p>]]></description>
