  <item>
    <title>EP20|《装逼相对论》—装逼门槛为什么一会高一会低的？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65ffdc7e2d9eae5d0aad539d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65ffdc7e2d9eae5d0aad539d</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 25 Mar 2024 00:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>脑子里突然冒出的话题，好好聊一聊我们都在装什么</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="16">00:16</a> “装逼敏感症”的自我批判</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="187">03:07</a> 我要怎么拆穿你才能又高姿态又装到？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="308">05:08</a> 装逼怪象：“我有一个朋友”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="599">09:59</a> 装逼的门槛太高了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1039">17:19</a> 人可以不装逼，但活着又有什么意思呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 强人和弱人的装逼模式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1293">21:33</a> 世界上没有脱离相对性存在的东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1507">25:07</a> 情商—装逼的最高形式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1563">26:03</a> 现在社会里的反主流价值观装逼：不学习&amp;恋爱脑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2017">33:37</a> 怎么装逼门槛又变低了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2107">35:07</a> &nbsp;选对能量低的装逼对象，所有事情都能装</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2134">35:34</a> MBTI装逼，真无语了。。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］（备注来意啊~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务合作：添加微信［glamorousgia］</span></strong></p>]]></description>
