    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期我们聊了聊《热辣滚烫》和贾玲导演与这部片子的极高适配度（赶个最末的班车）</span></p><p><span>有很让我们感动的细节，也引发了更多延申的思考，能聊出来的东西还挺多的。</span></p><p><span>非专业影评人~欢迎讨论~</span></p><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="46">00:46</a> 热辣滚烫是不是拿减肥当噱头的商业片？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="366">06:06</a> “乐莹” 贾玲内心的外化</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="495">08:15</a> “看心情吧”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 乐莹是讨好型人格吗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="745">12:25</a> 没有复仇情节，但更爽了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="944">15:44</a> 女导演温暖的镜头语言</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1009">16:49</a> 胖女人不配拥有性生活?</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1219">20:19</a> 假如是男导演拍《热辣滚烫》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1648">27:28</a> 关于电影的讨论生态</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1710">28:30</a> 到底怎样才算一个好电影？</span></p><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><p><span>本期音乐：《Sweet Talk》— Saint Motel</span></p><p><span>《送你一朵小红花》——Mr.田</span></p><p><span>网易云歌单：《蓬松计划》BGM</span></p><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］（备注来意啊~</span></p><p><strong><span>商务合作：添加微信［glamorousgia］</span></strong></p>]]></description>
