  <item>
    <title>EP18｜旅行的意义，我突然懂了—《香港澳门漫游记》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65d37ab7b6c9256aee02c6d2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65d37ab7b6c9256aee02c6d2</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 23 Feb 2024 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>得空了咱就出去多旅游，身体在路上，意想不到的各种体验和惊喜也在路上~</span></p><span></span><p><span>坐稳，我们要启动了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>⬇️前情提要，按需收听～</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 旅游目的地的选择</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="373">06:13</a> 港澳通行证办理tips</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>澳门篇：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="893">14:53</a> 澳门攻略之氹仔</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 在四个赌场里大走红毯后被领小孩桌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1189">19:49</a> 港澳打车真情吐槽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1441">24:01</a> 氹仔是个没有生活气息的美丽乌托邦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> 澳门美食推荐+为什么不让堂食！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2018">33:38</a> 被澳门气温背刺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2099">34:59</a> 生擒卷发棒，狂涂烫伤膏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2251">37:31</a> 伴手礼的价格门道儿</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>香港篇：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2476">41:16</a> 重庆大厦的邪门体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2617">43:37</a> 酒店选择：闹鬼、坟场、风水？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2661">44:21</a> 香港Citywalk：穿梭在城市感受新与旧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 香港：一座既包容又不包容的城市「生存容易，生活很难」</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2829">47:09</a> 紧凑、压抑—香港的寸土寸金</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2869">47:49</a> 东亚女人一生追求的松弛：在香港本地年轻女性身上体现得淋漓尽致。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2992">49:52</a> 发呆vs拍照：更丰富的感官感受</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>浅聊一下：长沙、珠海、深圳、三亚</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3272">54:32</a> 不好的住宿体验和快碎掉的前台</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3425">57:05</a>长沙的养眼天堂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3496">58:16</a> 非常好吃的长沙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3725">01:02:05</a> 孤单升舱遇抖腿哥和怼咕哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3968">01:06:08</a> 在沙滩堆了俩小时的城堡被路人一脚踩爆！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4035">01:07:15</a> 《杀生忏悔录》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4449">01:14:09</a> </span><strong><span>记录旅行，留存实感。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：《Sweet Talk》— Saint Motel</span></p><span></span><p><span>《夏日漱石》— 橘子海</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云歌单：《蓬松计划》BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］（备注来意啊~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务合作：添加微信［glamorousgia］</span></strong></p>]]></description>
