    <pubDate>Sat, 27 Jan 2024 03:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这一次，我要把失去的年味都找回来！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 春晚押题大盘点，导演组汗流浃背，我们替全前国人民尴尬！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a> 脱口秀演员上春晚：要么逗笑观众一整年，要么逗笑同行一整年。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="741">12:21</a> 《只此青绿—千里江山图》心灵深处的震撼、美的感动。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="955">15:55</a> 年味变淡是因为我们长大了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1019">16:59</a> 趁别人不注意，偷偷抱着马桶猛猛擦，我的年味我来赚！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a> 便利up，年味down</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1249">20:49</a> 需求在日常被碎片化满足，三不五时的就把年给过了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1441">24:01</a> 放炮：共享喜悦！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1496">24:56</a> 1000换10块，原来小孩姐才是商业鬼才！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1653">27:33</a> 家里十几口人睡一块，尽情享用二氧化碳！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1976">32:56</a> 硬生生把吃饺子搞成了大型交易现场（我是硬币饺子王！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> 沙糖桔、徐福记 这些年货是怎么做到全国统一的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2240">37:20</a> 今年春节，一起去当稻香村代购！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2378">39:38</a> 小孩子过年犯错误是可以被原谅的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3063">51:03</a> 普通的节日，平凡的幸福，最深入人心。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3644">01:00:44</a> 厚重又温暖的习俗，才是过年真正的意义。</span></p><span></span><p><span>#春节将至，《蓬松计划》在这里给大家拜年啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>祝大家的新年，平凡不平淡！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：《Sweet Talk》— Saint Motel</span></p><span></span><p><span>《That Don't Impress Me Much》— Dream Tunes</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云歌单：《蓬松计划》BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］（备注来意啊~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务合作：添加微信［glamorousgia］</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、网易云音乐、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、QQ音乐、漫播都可以找到我们~</span></p>]]></description>
