  <item>
    <title>EP15｜年末特辑：我们自在摇曳，生生不息。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/658e49abbf3589e89466ae1b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">658e49abbf3589e89466ae1b</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 29 Dec 2023 04:23:05 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>一、用五个词概括自己的2023：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【歌歌】：紧绷、收敛、清晰、主动、柔软</span></p><span></span><p><span>【夏夏】：流水、预脱离、交流、充实的闲的、抽象</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二、2023大复盘：最诚实的表达</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【歌歌时间线】⬇️</span></p><span></span><p><span>1.紧绷的上半年：从偏激的一意孤行，到温和的泰然处之—艰难的心路历程</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="158">02:38</a> 生病失眠，喘不上气，头上扎针—我只是想做到最好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="526">08:46</a> 我想尽可能给自己更多的机会去接受和面对挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span>2.柔软的下半年：尽可能宽容地去容纳身边发生的一切，主动性成就了我！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1149">19:09</a> 本人最擅长亲手搞砸一段美好的关系啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a> 活了二十多年，最近才终于作为一个独立的个体存在。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1728">28:48</a> 减少抵抗心理，才能获得更多的幸福感和能量。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1957">32:37</a> 快乐不是靠别人赏给我们的，是我们自己要去创造的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> “洗手怪”的光荣诞生！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2710">45:10</a> 亲手删掉了1500个微信好友</span></p><span></span><p><span>【夏夏时间线】⬇️</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2863">47:43</a> 我丢了手机咋不着急啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3057">50:57</a> 一直在比过去活得更好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3385">56:25</a> 预脱离：从内耗循环中抽离，做播客帮我树立了旗帜。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3602">01:00:02</a> #讨论：为什么这么多人爱做归因？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3862">01:04:22</a> 阶段性关系：美好过，就很美好。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4530">01:15:30</a> 聊天&amp;自我交流：模糊的想法变清晰，短暂的表达变永恒。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4921">01:22:01</a> 演出看多了的感悟：原来追星也会边际效益递减。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5111">01:25:11</a> live是生活的解药</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5224">01:27:04</a> 火龙果发色带来的自信和关注</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5465">01:31:05</a> 即兴表达，我是一点不过脑子。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三、新年期许：风暴将我们重新扬起</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【歌歌时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5585">01:33:05</a> 生活重心改变了，是不是一件好事？—J人发疯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5691">01:34:51</a> 越是索取，越是贫瘠。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5700">01:35:00</a> 敏感的人活的很划算啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5836">01:37:16</a> 反复破碎又重组的过程，造就了全新的我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【夏夏时间线】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5877">01:37:57</a> 读万卷书，行万里路。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6155">01:42:35</a> 真正去迈出第一步。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6265">01:44:25</a> 观察、接触、享受这个世界。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6500">01:48:20</a> 胆怯的人，永远活在遗憾之中。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>四、互相批评、互相祝福：我们在一片最温暖蓬松之地，找到了彼此。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6605">01:50:05</a> 夏夏和歌歌对彼此的期待</span></p><span></span><p><span>新年将至，《蓬松计划》感恩大家今年的陪伴，来年期待更好的我们再次相遇，祝大家新年快乐～</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期音乐：《Sweet Talk》— Saint Motel</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Every Time We Touch》— Dream Tunes</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云歌单：《蓬松计划》BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］（备注来意啊~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务合作：添加微信［glamorousgia］</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、网易云音乐、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、QQ音乐、漫播都可以找到我们~</span></p>]]></description>
