    <title>EP12｜都站在鄙视链的顶端了，为什么还会被人鄙视啊！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6573dbe554f87fe00fd62892</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6573dbe554f87fe00fd62892</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 09 Dec 2023 03:15:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>不要鄙视了别人就沾沾自喜，因为你也可能被别人鄙视；</span></p><span></span><p><span>反之，不要因为被人鄙视而气馁，因为你也可能随时鄙视别人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完这期，希望你能够对展现出来的每个自己都能够自洽。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="84">01:24</a> 偷买名创优品，然后东躲西藏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="210">03:30</a> 为了鄙视别人，我自己被局限了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="246">04:06</a> 不小心买到仿款，该如何自洽？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">05:15</a> &nbsp;买Fake应该被诟病吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="575">09:35</a> 买了全套intoyou唇泥，但出门只带阿玛尼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="650">10:50</a> 光腿神器，别太贪婪！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="719">11:59</a> 小众鄙视大众，大众也在鄙视“无脑追求小众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="818">13:38</a> 留学鄙视链：国门都没出也算留学？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="876">14:36</a> 音乐鄙视链：古典乐第一，说唱是个什么玩意</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1096">18:16</a> 我不当班长谁当？你们这帮呆子也配？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1180">19:40</a> 只要你想鄙视别人，总有比你弱的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1211">20:11</a> 你跟我炫耀，我就站在「低调鄙视链」上鄙视你！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《tired of california》— Nessa Barrett</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云歌单：《蓬松计划》BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］（备注来意啊~</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务合作：添加微信［glamorousgia］</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、网易云音乐、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、QQ音乐、漫播都可以找到我们~</span></p>]]></description>
