  <item>
    <title>EP11｜滋养身心的奇葩小爱好：创作、规整、折腾！（0成本）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65714682d6e0ff5822d0e01e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65714682d6e0ff5822d0e01e</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 07 Dec 2023 04:13:52 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>世上爱好千千万，没想到这些乱七八糟的也算是爱好！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我们挖掘了生活中，能感受到价值感or爽感的各类小事情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>也许莫名其妙，也许并不起眼，但他们却真真切切的滋养了我们。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span>一、创作输出类</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>1.语言输出类：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="109">1:49</a> 我们是真心实意喜欢开会</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="186">3:06</a> 和空气人说话，可爽！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">8:05</a> 编故事忽悠人：室友相信我买了套房！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="587">9:47</a> 和关晓彤打了十分钟电话？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>2.肢体动作创造类：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> 自制夜店！我是我自己的观众！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="887">14:47</a> 熄灯了，我要开始欣赏自己了</span></p><span></span><p><span>二、规整类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1117">18:37</a> 摘抄：我的生活不能没有摘抄本！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1278">21:18</a> 搜集信息但不去，凑够满减但不买，就是玩。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">25:26</a> 刷完这些视频，神清气爽！</span></p><span></span><p><span>三、折腾类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1673">27:53</a> 这些家具的位置非改不可吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1828">30:28</a> 21岁创业失败:自律社群里只有懒蛋</span></p><span></span><p><span>四、输入类</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2018">33:38</a>看小说：低成本过别人的人生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">34:34</a>看同人文：cp的特性被无限放大，总有糖吃咯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2179">36:19</a>多捕捉生活中的小习惯给自己带来的价值感</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Moody》— Savannah Sgro</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云歌单：《蓬松计划》BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】（备注来意呀～</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>商务合作：添加微信［glamorousgia］</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、网易云音乐、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、QQ音乐、漫播都可以找到我们~</span></p>]]></description>
