    <title>EP10| 按摩时技师和你聊天要作何反应？——服务中的糟糕体验</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6566b57e0500be931c2d8812</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6566b57e0500be931c2d8812</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 29 Nov 2023 03:52:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期灵感来源于两位主播的一次按摩体验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>当我们受到了糟糕的服务时，为什么无法直白的表达不满？</span></p><span></span><p><span>明明我们才是消费者啊！到底是谁在服务谁啊？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">1:40</a> 理发：头发狂吸二手烟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">4:46</a> 女大学生对待外卖大超时的最狠反馈：不说谢谢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="376">6:16</a>《燃冬》难看？按摩师第一个不同意！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="476">7:56</a> &nbsp;你这吃的都不好了怎么拍照啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="544">9:04</a> &nbsp;美甲刺客！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 花600多剃了个板寸 什么怨种</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="984">16:24</a> 买了三次灯，还是只能用浴霸照明</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1190">19:50</a> 歌歌的最糟糕出行体验：永久拉黑曹操出行！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1330">22:10</a> 夏夏的最生气出行体验：你担个p！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1514">25:14</a> 你有偷偷把服务行业工作者看作「弱势群体」吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1610">26:50</a> 服务vs产品，服务更有人情味</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1627">27:07</a> 消费者对服务质量容忍域越来越大了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1771">29:31</a> 国内外服务行业差异</span></p><span></span><p><span>*本期录制正值夏夏被病毒侵扰的 难受感冒时期，声音可能会稍有变化。</span></p><span></span><p><span>最近降温，各类病毒肆意传播，大家也要注意保暖和防护噢！</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期音乐】</span></p><span></span><p><span>《Don’t Mention My Name》-REYKO</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易云歌单：《蓬松计划》BGM</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p><span></span><p><span>加听友群：添加微信［BestMorning0202］（备注来意啊~</span></p><span></span><p><span>商务合作：添加微信［glamorousgia］</span></p><span></span><p><span>【收听方式】</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙、网易云音乐、苹果播客、喜马拉雅、QQ音乐、漫播都可以找到我们~</span></p>]]></description>
