    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>社交是一个在生活中、成长中无法避免的课题。</span></p><span></span><p><span>在人群中，我们越装强大、越渴望耀眼，内心其实越脆弱。</span></p><span></span><p><span>听完这期，希望你敢于直面自己内心的冲突，探索到「你的社交舒适区」</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="86">01:26</a> MBTI：又E又I</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="212">03:32</a> 社交“电量瓶”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> 交友：主动=冒昧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 判断F/T：当遇到一个会带来负面情绪的事时，第一反应是生气抱怨or立马去想解决方法</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="529">08:49</a> 怕搞僵关系顺从对方vs有啥说啥你错了就是错了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="809">13:29</a> J/P 秩序感&amp;掌控感</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="986">16:26</a> 趋于平和，很难痛苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1062">17:42</a> “搭子文化”：浅层次的交流？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1359">22:39</a> 如何看待阶段性朋友 说散就散</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1660">27:40</a> 朋友分级—在金钱上体现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2024">33:44</a> 社交小技巧：❌自我为中心的旺盛表达欲❌过度参与别人的课题</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2674">44:34</a> 别问在不在，借钱就不在</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2766">46:06</a> 钱和人情，你更愿意付出哪个？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2879">47:59</a> 社交成长史：自闭？无意义疯玩？找存在感？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3485">58:05</a> 社交敏感点：我们越装强大、越渴望耀眼，内心越脆弱。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3684">01:01:24</a> 朋友是自己选的家人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4093">01:08:13</a> 大学友情质量为什么低于高中？</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系我们】</span></p